<item><title>Kenya names bidders for three mineral projects, pending licences</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ke/kenya-names-bidders-for-three-mineral-projects-pending-bf6d0c/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ke/kenya-names-bidders-for-three-mineral-projects-pending-bf6d0c/</guid><category>Kenya</category><description>A US-led consortium won the Mrima Hill tender, while a Chinese joint venture was chosen for projects in Samburu and Tharaka Nithi.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 08:53:37 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ke.jpg" length="31123" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ke.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
